    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 43,
        "text": "Hi, Leo! You look tired. Are you okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5f71698ba2f0b1d5932b49bd065071e735662d1e807440b0ac42f2cf6e8b253e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 49,
        "sourceEnd": 186,
        "text": "Yeah, I'm fine. I just spent an hour trying to set up my new smart speaker. It's supposed to make life easier, but it's driving me crazy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f8c61fb7c9c66fd9a4e40b5ece281808b5c55bc9d1a6b5b864dc2ff2fa46120c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 192,
        "sourceEnd": 218,
        "text": "Oh no! What's the problem?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ec0392d7f523219ee02702972c3c1590117813312ac05160b0ad129eb0169059",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 224,
        "sourceEnd": 326,
        "text": "Well, I want to use it to play music and check the weather. But I can't get it to connect to my Wi-Fi.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "469b526bd4220ea7ce2e140340f8ae8b363df48c490d451c1e0d4ed547ee9651",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 332,
        "sourceEnd": 362,
        "text": "Did you read the instructions?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "72551cc2a4fce14f2e34fc8bf5b2f29e964f290c530ed946ffd92af247201135",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 368,
        "sourceEnd": 479,
        "text": "Of course I did! But they're not very clear. It says to press the button for five seconds, but nothing happens.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "f45bef38af46a9d220fc8f39d4b23f642320e265bdadfcc7833a46cc8861edbb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 485,
        "sourceEnd": 603,
        "text": "Hmm. Maybe you need to hold it longer? My brother has one, and he said you have to hold it until the light turns blue.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "dddfe79e6dabfddd97fdd87515db9b78c1c0f2ab9b615b6e2377a3ebc5f582e6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 609,
        "sourceEnd": 673,
        "text": "Oh, really? Let me try that. ... Okay, it's working now! Thanks!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a95cd58a5bb37cabbf2093aa05aa17278121963cce6e8c9c950cce66327f1a78",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 679,
        "sourceEnd": 715,
        "text": "No problem. So, what else can it do?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "26a2e451e3b80315062c6c21d3ad502fc87dcb569dec7b939b6cf6ea5471e45f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 721,
        "sourceEnd": 807,
        "text": "It can set alarms, read the news, and even order pizza. But I mainly use it for music.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7d471d2e24a257872222160da36c7d36ad116f6349d60329ac8f5141e050e3e8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 813,
        "sourceEnd": 914,
        "text": "That's cool. I'm thinking about getting a smart plug. You can use it to turn off appliances remotely.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "4753c3b98e1a44a533d27db4ba3a6242db9ae7c011b2ff0434fc6d71c5d44403",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 920,
        "sourceEnd": 1021,
        "text": "That sounds useful. But aren't you worried about privacy? I heard these devices are always listening.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d78c1b3a054fbcbe7bdc7841c6d6e4b83e82743c87c81846204052c204c2a4bb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1027,
        "sourceEnd": 1132,
        "text": "Well, you can turn off the microphone when you're not using it. And the data is supposed to be kept safe.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "84ce5f1712ad77e7513ab2f9520b177739547b6487e980df0da9ef623604928a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1138,
        "sourceEnd": 1236,
        "text": "I guess so. But I still prefer to do things manually. I don't like relying on technology too much.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "335c616a7e9b4b709b2d9701edcb7d8b4212286f205e1fa04f0b0dc580ac4fff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1242,
        "sourceEnd": 1341,
        "text": "I understand. But for me, these tools are designed to save time. I can use the extra time to relax.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ede0efff841ae10c37534e08fb72588c86b12994769c93c2cdbe3083ea7e72b9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "leo",
        "speaker": "Leo",
        "sourceStart": 1347,
        "sourceEnd": 1429,
        "text": "That's a good point. Maybe I'll get used to it. Anyway, I need to go now. See you!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "054dbc4e4c8648d389c91eac62eddf7710175eeb3659fbe34702e5674660dad5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1435,
        "sourceEnd": 1478,
        "text": "See you! Good luck with your smart speaker!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e879b663d64e361798e25360707c8d9d9e44c6658d76f458f176b56339501705",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
